*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% Color StyleWriter PPD (1500, 2200, 2400, 2500) for the swii-cups CUPS
*% raster filter (rastertostylewriter) and backend (stylewriter).
*% Original lpstyl driver by Monroe Williams <monroe@pobox.com>.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "STYLWCL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Apple"
*Product: "(StyleWriter)"
*ModelName: "Apple Color StyleWriter 1500/2200/2400/2500"
*ShortNickName: "Color StyleWriter"
*NickName: "Apple Color StyleWriter 1500/2200/2400/2500, swii-cups"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*cupsVersion: 1.2
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertostylewriter"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK

*OpenGroup: General/General
*OpenUI *Model/Printer Model: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Model
*DefaultModel: SW1500
*Model SW1500/Color StyleWriter 1500: ""
*Model SW2200/Color StyleWriter 2200: ""
*Model SW2400/Color StyleWriter 2400: ""
*Model SW2500/Color StyleWriter 2500: ""
*CloseUI: *Model

*OpenUI *InkCartridge/Ink Cartridge: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *InkCartridge
*DefaultInkCartridge: Black
*InkCartridge Black/Black Cartridge: "<</cupsColorSpace 8 /cupsColorOrder 1>>setpagedevice"
*InkCartridge Color/Color Cartridge: "<</cupsColorSpace 8 /cupsColorOrder 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *InkCartridge

*OpenUI *Quality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Quality
*DefaultQuality: 1
*Quality 1/Normal: ""
*Quality 2/High: ""
*CloseUI: *Quality

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 25 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 360dpi
*Resolution 360dpi/360 DPI: "<</HWResolution [360 360]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*CloseGroup: General

*OpenGroup: Paper/Paper Handling
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "18 18 594 774"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 18 577 824"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"

*HWMargins: "18 18 18 18"
*CloseGroup: Paper
